      "prompt": "Simplify 16^(3/2) × 16^-1, giving your answer as a fraction where necessary.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "16^(1/2) is the square root of 16, which is 4, so 16^(3/2) = 4^3",
        "16^-1 = 1/16^1 = 1/4^2",
        "16^(3/2) × 16^-1 = 4^3 × 1/4^2 = 4^(3-2) = 4^1",
        "4^1 = 4"
